# --- Room 1/25 ---
dig Blightwood Marsh - Entrance
@desc Your boots sink into the desolate muck with every step. filtered light barely penetrates the foreboding canopy, and you hear muffled voices coming from the foreboding shadows.
@tags/set room-zone:blightwood_marsh
@open south=south to Blightwood Marsh - Ridge
@open east=east to Blightwood Marsh - Bend

